ts across 438 files**, with no failures, skipped or cancelled tests. Source checks, production reproduction and ordinary build/freeze passed.\n- Native checks cover action focus, failure/retry, reading preferences and ordinary browser Back. They do not establish actual BFCache admission, downloaded export-byte correctness, physical controllers/touch or fresh offline operation.\n\nSource: `d77ea4f5c2aeccf2ba3bdf483a3f25531f8095b6`. Source PR: #90. Predecessor: [v0.60.3](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/tag/v0.60.3), preserved unchanged in Archive19.\n\nThe frozen archive passed inspection against the exact source and all **682 runtime files**. Original release assets and qualification evidence are attached. GitHub Pages deployment and affected browser journeys require verification after publication. **P03 navigation and P05 presentation remain incomplete.**\n"}